{"title":"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #10</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #13</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Karl had his salary reduced by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. He was later promoted and his salary was increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. If his initial salary was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de24fa2ea792943b3f0abcd11d11d9ff3326820e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, what is his present salary?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1ab839f972de59a2cfb2580ccb26b24f0624fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$16~200 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$19~800 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$20~000 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$20~500 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$24~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"643\" height=\"19\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Karl's salary was reduced by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, that means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870303feff6f491471061a7402eba3e326ba84f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the initial salary was remaining before the promotion. Thus, he had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/8090a37fc3f670d7380461db2e7b360aa2b88c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\% \\times \\$20~000 = \\frac{9}{10} \\times \\$20~000 = \\$18~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"330\" height=\"38\" /> left.\n</p><p>After his promotion, this was then raised by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, so his salary is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5ba02e8a478db5587cb55c8820737df0f544b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> times what it was before he got promoted.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/f/71fe6e6c303d8b7f9123d7b345a7522f08d3b87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$18 000 \\times 110\\% = \\$18~000 \\times \\frac{11}{10} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } \\$19~800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the initial salary. After it was reduced, he had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257c30822d9c7e65d2c8ce8f583571f498f357b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{10}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" /> for his salary.\n</p><p>After his promotion, he then had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3dc5f9060179f5b577f36a9e28abe490250bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{10}x \\times \\frac{11}{10} = \\frac{99}{100}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" /> for the salary.\n</p><p>Since we know the initial salary was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de24fa2ea792943b3f0abcd11d11d9ff3326820e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/8951a267d001004c00570f03c854b464efbfa568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\$20~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4ecf45e9cce0bb0a636eb105585fc992dc9e1b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{99}{100} \\times \\$20~000 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } \\$19~800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/